title: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Checks, versions and send back
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=draft
intro: Under the medical necessity request, one click away: Integrity's four checks and 'Re-check', the version list and its read-only viewer, and 'Send back to Scribe'. The header carries the same count as a chip.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Re-check' and 'Send back to Scribe' are simulated waits. Sending back logs it and shows a toast but does not redraft the text.
---
start s1 "Under the draft"
screen hc "Header chip 'Integrity 2/4' (amber) or 'Integrity 4/4' (green)\nwhile the request is being prepared\nhover: the checks that are open"
click hcc "Click the chip"
process gt "'Clinical picture & draft' opens"
screen ck "Fold 'Integrity checks' with '2 open' or '4/4'"
click ok "Open it"
process c1 "Four rows: 'Every sentence matches the chart', 'Payer criteria are covered',\n'Dates are consistent', 'Identifiers are protected'"
decision dok "Does each check pass?"
process pass "Green tick and 'Pass'"
process warn "Amber triangle, 'Warn' and a note\ne.g. 'Sertraline start is 9/14 in the medication list and 9/21 in the psychiatric evaluation.'"
process why "A warning clears when the matching action is applied\n(criteria and dates), or on 'Re-check' after an edit (chart)"

click rc "Click 'Re-check'"
agent ig "Integrity reads the draft again\nabout 1.6 seconds (demo: simulated)"
store mr "Edit flag cleared\nHistory: 'Integrity read the draft again' flagged 'Agent'"
decision dst "Do other checks still warn?"
toast t1 "'All four checks passed'"
toast t2 "'1 check needs an action'\n'Apply the matching recommendation, then check again.'"

screen vs "Fold 'Versions' with the count"
click vo "Open it"
process cu "Newest first: version, time, author, note\nthe newest carries 'Current', older rows have 'View'"
click vw "Click 'View' on an older version"
overlay vm "Pop-up 'Version 2', read only"
click vc "Click 'Close', the X, the dimmed area, or press Esc"

click sk "Click 'Send back to Scribe'"
store lg "History: 'You sent the draft back to Scribe' flagged 'Logged decision'"
toast tb "'Sent back to Scribe'"
goto gS "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Review, sign and what happens next"

s1 --> hc --> hcc --> gt --> ck
s1 --> ck --> ok --> c1 --> dok
dok -->|Yes| pass
dok -->|No| warn --> why
c1 --> rc --> ig --> mr --> dst
dst -->|No| t1
dst -->|Yes| t2
s1 --> vs --> vo --> cu --> vw --> vm --> vc
s1 --> sk --> lg --> tb
t1 --> gS
